\\"Are your screens suitable for Oman's coastal climate?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes — for Muscat and coastal sites we specify conformal-coated modules and IP65 cabinets that resist humidity and salt air, with brightness headroom for intense sunlight. Khareef-season humidity in Salalah is factored into ventilation design.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Which sectors do you serve in Oman?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Retail malls, hotels and resorts, government reception areas and outdoor advertising operators make up most of our Oman work. Solutions range from lobby video walls to large outdoor billboards and mosque/majlis displays.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How much does an LED screen cost in Oman?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Budgets track our UAE pricing plus freight — indoor walls from approximately OMR 250 per square metre and outdoor screens from OMR 180 per square metre depending on pitch and structure. Firm quotations are issued within 24 hours.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What support do you provide after installation in Oman?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Installations include a 2-year warranty, remote monitoring and a spare-module pack so most repairs are done on site instantly. Scheduled maintenance visits to Muscat are combined with our regular Oman service runs.\\\"}}]}9:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"main\\\",null,{\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"WebPage\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LED Screens Oman from OMR 180/m\\\\\\\\u00b2 | Muscat Delivery | Brightluxx\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LED screens delivered to Muscat in 4\\\\\\\\u20138 days \\\\\\\\u2014 outdoor from OMR 180/m\\\\\\\\u00b2, indoor from OMR 250/m\\\\\\\\u00b2. Coastal-climate rated, 2-year warranty, installed by our GCC team.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/oman\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"publisher\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"logo\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\\\\\\\"}}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"itemListElement\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Home\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\"}, {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\": 2, \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LED Screens Oman from OMR 180/m\\\\\\\\u00b2 | Muscat Delivery | Brightluxx\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/oman\\\\\\\"}]}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"legalName\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"logo\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"contactPoint\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ContactPoint\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"contactType\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"sales\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"SA\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"QA\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"KW\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"BH\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"OM\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"availableLanguage\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"en\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"ar\\\\\\\"]}}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LocalBusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"priceRange\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\\\\\u00b2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"geo\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"GeoCoordinates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"latitude\\\\\\\": 24.9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$13\\\"}}]],\\\"$L14\\\"]}]\\n15:Tb46,\\u003ch1\\u003eLED Screens Oman from OMR 180/m² | Muscat Delivery | Brightluxx\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eLED screens delivered to Muscat in 4–8 days — outdoor from OMR 180/m², indoor from OMR 250/m². Coastal-climate rated, 2-year warranty, installed by our GCC team.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eOman Areas We Serve\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eQurum \\u0026amp; Al Khuwair\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Muscat's commercial spine — showrooms, offices and mall displays.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eMutrah \\u0026amp; Ruwi\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Souq-adjacent retail and hotel installations along the corniche.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSeeb \\u0026amp; Muscat Airport\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Airport-corridor hospitality, exhibitions and Oman Convention Centre events.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSalalah\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Khareef-season tourism venues — humidity-rated outdoor specification.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSohar\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Port and industrial-zone operations displays.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eOman Signage Regulations \\u0026amp; Power\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eMuscat Municipality Permit\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eExternal advertising screens require Muscat Municipality approval covering placement, size and content — we prepare the supporting technical file.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eNama / MEDC Power Standards\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eInstallations are specified to Oman's 240V/50Hz distribution standards with approved load calculations for larger screens.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHumidity \\u0026amp; Khareef Specification\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eCoastal Muscat and Salalah's khareef season demand conformal coating, IP65 sealing and ventilation design rated for sustained 90%+ humidity.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eLED Display FAQs — Oman\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eDo you deliver and install LED displays in Muscat?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes — Oman is served by road freight from Dubai, usually 4 to 8 days door-to-door to Muscat including customs at Hatta/Al Wajajah. Our engineers handle surveys, installation supervision and commissioning on site.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eAre your screens suitable for Oman's coastal climate?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes — for Muscat and coastal sites we specify conformal-coated modules and IP65 cabinets that resist humidity and salt air, with brightness headroom for intense sunlight. Khareef-season humidity in Salalah is factored into ventilation design.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhich sectors do you serve in Oman?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eRetail malls, hotels and resorts, government reception areas and outdoor advertising operators make up most of our Oman work. Solutions range from lobby video walls to large outdoor billboards and mosque/majlis displays.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow much does an LED screen cost in Oman?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBudgets track our UAE pricing plus freight — indoor walls from approximately OMR 250 per square metre and outdoor screens from OMR 180 per square metre depending on pitch and structure. Firm quotations are issued within 24 hours.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat support do you provide after installation in Oman?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eInstallations include a 2-year warranty, remote monitoring and a spare-module pack so most repairs are done on site instantly. Scheduled maintenance visits to Muscat are combined with our regular Oman service runs.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nf:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\nc:null\\n11:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"LED Screens Oman from OMR 180/m² | Muscat Delivery | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"LED screens delivered to Muscat in 4–8 days — outdoor from OMR 180/m², indoor from OMR 250/m². Coastal-climate rated, 2-year warranty, installed by our GCC team.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/oman\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[48303,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"SiteHeader\"]\n4:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"default\"]\n5:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"\"]\n7:I[52006,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"FloatingActions\"]\n8:I[81888,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"CookieConsent\"]\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\nb:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\ne:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n10:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n12:I[68027,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"default\",1]\n:HL[\"/_next/static