ason tourism venues — humidity-rated outdoor specification.</li><li><strong>Sohar</strong>: Port and industrial-zone operations displays.</li></ul><h2>Oman Signage Regulations &amp; Power</h2><h3>Muscat Municipality Permit</h3><p>External advertising screens require Muscat Municipality approval covering placement, size and content — we prepare the supporting technical file.</p><h3>Nama / MEDC Power Standards</h3><p>Installations are specified to Oman's 240V/50Hz distribution standards with approved load calculations for larger screens.</p><h3>Humidity &amp; Khareef Specification</h3><p>Coastal Muscat and Salalah's khareef season demand conformal coating, IP65 sealing and ventilation design rated for sustained 90%+ humidity.</p><h2>LED Display FAQs — Oman</h2><h3>Do you deliver and install LED displays in Muscat?</h3><p>Yes — Oman is served by road freight from Dubai, usually 4 to 8 days door-to-door to Muscat including customs at Hatta/Al Wajajah. Our engineers handle surveys, installation supervision and commissioning on site.</p><h3>Are your screens suitable for Oman's coastal climate?</h3><p>Yes — for Muscat and coastal sites we specify conformal-coated modules and IP65 cabinets that resist humidity and salt air, with brightness headroom for intense sunlight. Khareef-season humidity in Salalah is factored into ventilation design.</p><h3>Which sectors do you serve in Oman?</h3><p>Retail malls, hotels and resorts, government reception areas and outdoor advertising operators make up most of our Oman work. Solutions range from lobby video walls to large outdoor billboards and mosque/majlis displays.</p><h3>How much does an LED screen cost in Oman?</h3><p>Budgets track our UAE pricing plus freight — indoor walls from approximately OMR 250 per square metre and outdoor screens from OMR 180 per square metre depending on pitch and structure. Firm quotations are issued within 24 hours.</p><h3>What support do you provide after installation in Oman?</h3><p>Installations include a 2-year warranty, remote monitoring and a spare-module pack so most repairs are done on site instantly. Scheduled maintenance visits to Muscat are combined with our regular Oman service runs.</p>3:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}]\n4:[\"$\",\"$L11\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$12\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@13\"}]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L14\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$12\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"LED Screens Oman from OMR 180/m² | Muscat Delivery | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"LED screens delivered to Muscat in 4–8 days — outdoor from OMR 180/m², indoor from OMR 250/m². Coastal-climate rated, 2-year warranty, installed by our GCC team.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/oman\"}]]}]}]}],null]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L16\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{}]}]]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/37aunjb6qe2jr.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\",\"async\":true}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L16\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{}],\"notFound\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"not-found\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"children\":\"404 — Page Not Found\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{